/T (1\) Path 1: Specialized-Feature Path This path, shown in Fig. 3, is designed to learn deep independent                             features for each modality. It consists of four identical but separate \(non-weight-sharing\) 3D CNN streams. Architecture: per stream: Each stream is a compact 3D CNN. The input \(128, 128, 128, 1\) volume is fed to three convolutional blocks. Each block contains Conv3D \(3x3x3 kernel\), BatchNormalization, ReLU activation followed by MaxPool3D \(2x2x2\))
/E (1\) Path 1: Specialized-Feature Path This path, shown in Fig. 3, is designed to learn deep independent                             features for each modality. It consists of four identical but separate \(non-weight-sharing\) 3D CNN streams. Architecture: per stream: Each stream is a compact 3D CNN. The input \(128, 128, 128, 1\) volume is fed to three convolutional blocks. Each block contains Conv3D \(3x3x3 kernel\), BatchNormalization, ReLU activation followed by MaxPool3D \(2x2x2\))
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
